{"title":"Biology competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>There are many species of <b>Biology competitions</b>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#International_Biology_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">International Biology competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#National_Biology_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National Biology competitions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Canada\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Canada</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#United_States\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">United States</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Regional_Biology_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Regional Biology competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Resources</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Books\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Books</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Online_Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Online Resources</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"International_Biology_competitions\">International Biology competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: International Biology competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Biology_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"International Biology Olympiad (page does not exist)\">International Biology Olympiad</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ibo-info.org/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_Biology_competitions\">National Biology competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: National Biology competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Canada\">Canada</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Canada\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Toronto_National_Biology_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"University of Toronto National Biology Olympiad (page does not exist)\">University of Toronto National Biology Olympiad</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.biocomp.utoronto.ca/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"United_States\">United States</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: United States\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=United_States_Biology_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"United States Biology Olympiad (page does not exist)\">United States Biology Olympiad</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.cee.org/usabo/index.shtml\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Regional_Biology_competitions\">Regional Biology competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Regional Biology competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Books\">Books</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Books\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0135188741/artofproblems-20\">Campbell Biology</a> by Campbell, Urry, Wasserman, Cain, Minorsky, and Orr.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Online_Resources\">Online Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Online Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://competifylabs.com/\">CompetifyLabs</a> Custom-made topic-tailored problems across biology preparation across honors bio to USABO/IBO level - earn volunteer hours from problem writing!</li>\n<li>CompetifyHub's Problem Sets <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://competifyhub.com/services-2/\">Free Competition and Learning Resources for Grades 1-12</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_scholarships\" title=\"Biology scholarships\">Biology scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_competitions\" title=\"Science competitions\">Science competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017211736\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 30/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_: